@0    = ~Well, well... If it isn't the Bhaalspawn I encountered in Athkatla! I had a feeling our paths would cross sooner or later. I was traveling south on business and stopped in Saradush for the night. Of course, those damn giants chose that very moment to besiege the city! Now I find myself trapped here with everyone else, while my associates in Calimshan are wondering where their promised deliveries have gone.~
@1    = ~Unfortunately, convincing the local guards to let me leave the city requires a substantial amount of gold, and my purse is not a Bag of Holding. Fortunately for you, I have some of the most valuable relics from my collection here with me. Normally, I would only part with these artifacts for a small fortune, but given the... unusual circumstances, I am willing to give you a considerable discount. Would you like to see my special wares?~
@2    = ~Let's see what you have.~
@3    = ~No, thank you.~
